.TH CARGO-PGRX-0201 1 "2026-11-23" "PGSTY" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
cargo-pgrx-0201 \- run cargo-pgrx 0.20.1 with the current PGSTY Rust toolchain
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B cargo-pgrx-0201
.I subcommand
.RI [ arguments ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B cargo-pgrx-0201
runs cargo-pgrx 0.20.1 with the current packaged Rust toolchain. Unless
PGRX_HOME is already set, configuration is isolated under
$HOME/.pgrx/0.20.1.
.SH REQUIREMENTS
Requires rust-toolchain 1.99.1 or newer. Extension builds also require
PostgreSQL development headers and a C compiler.
For 0.20.1, clang must match the libclang major version; use llvm-ar from
the same LLVM release. PostgreSQL 15 through 19 are supported.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B cargo-pgrx-0201 --version
Display the cargo-pgrx version.
.TP
.B cargo-pgrx-0201 init --pg17=/usr/pgsql-17/bin/pg_config --no-run
Initialize an RPM-style PostgreSQL 17 development configuration.
.TP
.B cargo-pgrx-0201 package --pg-config=/usr/lib/postgresql/17/bin/pg_config
Build a Debian-style PostgreSQL 17 extension package directory.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/lib/pgsty/cargo-pgrx/0.20.1
Versioned cargo-pgrx program root.
.TP
.I $HOME/.pgrx/0.20.1
Default per-user configuration directory.
